OL,3,ATyphoons batter East Asia as El Nino
OL,4,Amakes Pacific 'burn with fever'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWild weather is a way of life for
OL,7,Fpeople living along the coast in the
OL,8,FPhilippines, Taiwan, China and Japan.
OL,9,FBut the last few months have been
OL,10,Fextraordinary.
OL,12,FA wave of intense and, at times,
OL,13,Funpredictable storms exacerbated by the
OL,14,FEl Nino weather pattern has killed
OL,15,Fdozens, shuttered major airports and
OL,16,Fwiped out crops and infrastructure
OL,17,Facross a swathe of East Asia.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
