OL,3,ATyphoons batter East Asia as El Nino
OL,4,Amakes Pacific 'burn with fever'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn October, nearly all of Taiwan shut
OL,7,Fdown as a monster storm big enough to
OL,8,Fengulf the island of 23 million roared
OL,9,Ftowards its north-eastern coast.
OL,10,FEquivalent to a category five
OL,11,Fhurricane, Typhoon Champi's 295km/h
OL,12,F(193mph) winds had the power to flatten
OL,13,Fhomes and whip up destructive waves.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
