OL,3,ATyphoons batter East Asia as El Nino
OL,4,Amakes Pacific 'burn with fever'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThankfully it did not make landfall in
OL,7,FTaiwan, skirting past the island while
OL,8,Fdousing it in rain. But it had
OL,9,Ffar-reaching impacts: hundreds of
OL,10,Fflights were cancelled in Hong Kong,
OL,11,FTaiwan and Japan. In the Philippines'
OL,12,FBatanes archipelago, seaside highways
OL,13,Fshut as huge waves crashed onto the
OL,14,Fshore, and in southern Japan's Okinawa
OL,15,Fislands, power was cut to 15,000 homes.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
